The source is "cbaebabacd".
The pattern is "abc".
The target is sort characters of pattern.
The size is 3.
The laststart is 7.
The answers is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every start from 0 to laststart.
The finish is start plus size.
The piece is the slice of source from start to finish.
The ordered is sort characters of piece.
If ordered matches target, Place start into answers.

The line is empty text.
For each answer in answers.
If the length of line is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place format whole number answer as text into line.

Show line.
